{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"ee278cbe1ba539c29b1b8cd93603b3d69a1f5e086d588340d72fb4970b1b19cf"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:2d1052227976f6d9004d2b89010ecc56917f592d3062aa89ac10b64f7d4fed1e","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"A couple of sweet homemade treats","evidence":"[D2:25 | 6:10 pm on 22 December, 2022] Maria: I can picture you all laughing and having a blast making your own pizzas - a great way to bond! I made some peach cobbler recently, it was great.\n[D13:18 | 3:18 pm on 4 May, 2023] Maria: Thanks, John! It had lots of great things like salads, sandwiches, and homemade desserts. My favorite is the amazing banana split sundae - I enjoy it after a day of volunteering. It's a little moment of joy in life - balance is key!","itemId":"urn:uuid:630855a5-8dfb-5db5-b69e-421c23d10f0c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:a28036c7cef25486637545fb1bc43c9abf78e65393e677ce04db289c90fab72b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What desserts has Maria made?","referenceAnswer":"Banana split sundae, Peach cobbler","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"a28036c7cef25486637545fb1bc43c9abf78e65393e677ce04db289c90fab72b"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}